My Budget Manager is a simple app for easily track and manage your monthly budget and view your balance based on your income and expenses.

Features:
- Create an unlimited number of accounts(i.e. family, trip etc);
- Setup reminders for each income or expense;
- View all your income and expenses in a map;
- Recover existing backups;
- Integrated with touch id, which increases security;
- Works offline;
- Backup with iCloud;
- Export your data to CSV;
- Charts;

The app is free but it has some limitations. To remove ads and add more than 10 expenses in a month, the user must subscribe to the Premium Package.

